%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'flowchart': {'htmlLabels': false}}}%%
flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> upload[POST /api/v1/files/upload\nfile + case_id]

    upload --> mime_check{MIME type\nallowed?\nPDF PNG JPEG\nTIFF BMP WebP\nGIF HEIC}
    mime_check -->|NO| err400[Return 400\nInvalid MIME type]
    err400 --> END_400([END])

    mime_check -->|YES| size_check{File size\n<= 20 MB?}
    size_check -->|NO| err413[Return 413\nFile too large]
    err413 --> END_413([END])

    size_check -->|YES| minio[Store binary in MinIO\nobject_key returned]

    minio --> text_check{Image-based\nor PDF?}

    text_check -->|Image PNG/JPEG/TIFF/BMP| restore[restore_image\nCLAHE contrast on LAB L-channel\nresize if > 4000px]
    restore --> persp[perspective_correct\n1 Canny edge-contour detection\n2 adaptive-threshold fallback\ndewarp + safety guards]
    persp --> qari[QARI Qwen2VL inference\nNAMAA-Space/Qari-OCR-v0.3-VL-2B\n8-bit quantized GPU max 4000 tokens\nstrict transcription - no correction]
    qari --> norm[normalize_numerals\nArabic-Indic digit conversion]
    norm --> confidence[compute_page_confidence\ntoken softmax probabilities\npage-level + per-word]
    confidence --> conf_tier{Tier}
    conf_tier -->|high| accept_hi[Accept - no flag]
    conf_tier -->|medium| accept_med[Accept with\nreview recommended flag]
    conf_tier -->|low| flag_low[Flag for\nmanual correction]
    accept_hi --> chunk
    accept_med --> chunk
    flag_low --> chunk

    text_check -->|PDF with text layer| extract_text[Extract text layer\ndirectly - no OCR]
    extract_text --> chunk

    chunk[Segment text into chunks]
    chunk --> embed[TEI embed chunks\nBAAI/bge-m3 1024-dim]
    embed --> qdrant[Upsert vectors to Qdrant\ncase_docs collection\nfiltered by case_id]
    qdrant --> mongo[Store metadata in MongoDB\ndoc_type + party + confidence_tier\nobject_key + chunk_ids]
    mongo --> END_OK[Return 201\ndocument_id + confidence_tier]
    END_OK --> END([END])
